# WATER-LOOK: the water surface's ripples (WaterSurface.shader WaterRipples): octaves of several sizes, the slopes a
# pixel cannot draw become roughness, the lake's own material.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/Water_Buoyancy.desce
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,180,-1200
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.2,1
Тогда-вид 1_near мелкая мягкая рябь нескольких размеров, без щетины, читается отражение неба
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,600,-6000
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.08,1
Тогда-вид 2_far ровный широкий блик, без шума и повторяющегося узора
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,1500,-1500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.98,0.2
Тогда-вид 3_above без видимой плитки, цвет воды по глубине
# LAND-BACKLOG3 (proof by WP-PROOF-1126): the lake is drawn by the SingleLayerWater shading model
# (ShadingModels/SingleLayerWater.shadingmodel, Pass_SingleLayerWater in module Desert/Water) after the batch landing.
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,400,-3000
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.15,1
Тогда-вид 4_slw LAND-BACKLOG3 SingleLayerWater: the lake surface present (not missing, not black, not opaque grey), the bottom seen through near water, colour by depth further out, the sky reflected; editor.log has no shader compile error naming SingleLayerWater
